      new Paragraph({ spacing: { after: 140 }, children: [new TextRun("")] }),
      P("Two notes on the additions.", { bold: true }),
      P("The Medical Director Structuring Brief is not legal advice and does not replace California healthcare counsel. It is a plain-language brief on how the medical corporation and management services organization structure typically works in California, what a compliant medical director relationship actually requires in terms of involvement, and the questions to ask a candidate. You should still retain a California healthcare attorney. This brief tells you what to ask them."),
      P("Advisory Introductions are free and I will make them regardless of whether you engage us. I would like to connect you with the operator in Scottsdale running the hyperbaric chamber I mentioned, because her utilization numbers are real and she is as analytical as you are. I also have a contact on the American Med Spa Association board who works with new operators. If you would like a branding partner, I have one I trust, and we do not take a fee on that referral."),

