      P("I am not going to pretend this proposal is not also the front door. It is. Here is the honest version of what is behind it, so you can evaluate the whole path rather than one step of it."),
      P("When you are staffed, licensed, and within roughly sixty days of opening, our standard engagement becomes appropriate. It runs ninety days and comes in two forms."),
      table(
        [{ h: "Program", w: 2900, align: AlignmentType.LEFT },
         { h: "Structure", w: 4300, align: AlignmentType.LEFT },
         { h: "Investment", w: 2160, align: AlignmentType.RIGHT }],
        [
          ["Growth Engine, Done With You", "We advise, your team executes. Full playbook library, TLC AI access, private Slack channel, monthly call with Bethany.", "$9,000 / 90 days"],
          ["Growth Engine, Done For You", "Our team implements. Marketing systems, patient journey, automation, reporting. Biweekly calls throughout.", "$15,000 / 90 days"],
          ["Ongoing Partnership", "Month to month. No term contract. Scope-dependent.", "$1,500 to $3,000 / month"],
